      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tighter">
        Frequently Asked <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 to-amber-600">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-500">Everything you need to know about RetainOS.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
