        { q: 'Do patients need to download a new app?', a: 'Yes — your patients download your custom-branded app from the Apple App Store and Google Play. They use it to book appointments, earn loyalty points, make payments, and receive recall notifications.' },
        { q: 'How does the pricing work?', a: 'Plans start at $299/month per location with no long-term contract. All modules — loyalty, recall, payments, analytics — are included. Volume discounts are available for multi-location groups.' },
        { q: 'Does RetainOS integrate with my existing PMS?', a: 'Yes, we integrate with the major Practice Management Systems including Dentrix, Eaglesoft, Open Dental, and more. Our team handles the integration during onboarding.' },
        { q: 'What happens if a patient misses their appointment?', a: 'RetainOS automatically triggers a reactivation sequence — an SMS reminder, a push notification, and a follow-up email over 3 days. Your team doesn\'t lift a finger.' },
        { q: 'Is my patient data secure?', a: 'Yes. RetainOS is HIPAA-compliant with SOC 2 Type II certification. All data is encrypted at rest (AES-256) and in transit (TLS 1.3). We undergo annual third-party security audits.' },
        { q: 'Can patients earn rewards on paid treatments?', a: 'Absolutely. You define the earning rules — points per dollar, bonus points for specific treatments, and VIP tier multipliers. Patients redeem points toward future services.' },
